From: Codex local A376B compatibility adaptation
Subject: [PATCH] 0048-m2-face-omission-finalization-audit

Reason: User explicitly selected omitting Face Unlock. Late vendor restoration/finalization and the release verifier still required/claimed Face HAL and built-in bridge. Skip only Face restoration/checks for the reviewed M2 A376B16 star2lte profile; clean/audit Face VINTF/init after all restores and before packaging. Reset profile flags to prevent M1/M2 shell leakage. Keep FaceManager feature XML and all ADB/kernel/radio/other release checks.
Files: unica/patches/exynos9810_device_stack/exynos9810_finalization/customize.sh; scripts/internal/verify_exynos9810_release_defaults.py; scripts/internal/verify_face_omission.py; scripts/make_rom.sh; target/star2lte/profiles/m1-g965f-no-ksu.sh.
Verification: Face manifest/init restored fixtures rejected, unrelated radio preserved, actual incomplete staged tree omission preflight PASS, M2-to-M1 profile reset PASS, syntax and patch replay. Whole-ROM compiled ADB/release checks still required.

